         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Naming Numbers\n\nEvery number has its name, but here we will only deal with number families, or orders.\n\nThese number families follow a pattern shown below:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "|Family / Order|First number|Last number|\n|-----|-----|------|\n|Unit|0|9|\n|Ten|10|99|\n|Hundred|100|999|\n|Thousand|1,000|9,999|\n|Ten thousand|10,000|99,999|\n|Hundred thousand|100,000|999,999|\n|Million|1,000,000|9,999,999|\n|Ten million|10,000,000|99,999,999|\n|Hundred million|100,000,000|999,999,999|\n|Billion|1,000,000,000|9,999,999,999|",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": true,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "93d4b480-5efe-4eb8-b9e0-179560c53ec3",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "93d4b480-5efe-4eb8-b9e0-179560c53ec3",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "On the previous screen, we listed numbers up to a billion. Are there more numbers?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "3269d049-27cc-4a00-9191-11ca2d07555b",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "3269d049-27cc-4a00-9191-11ca2d07555b",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "party",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we saw that numbers are grouped into families. Each family ends when all its orders reach the value 9. When that happens, we move to the next family.\n\nAlthough we have only listed a few number families, this is not the end.\n\nIn the next lessons, we will continue studying other numbers.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
